    "detailed_description": "Help Boomer dash and float through this precision platformer above the clouds. Collect fragments to unlock shrines and rebuild his world. Unlock secrets and piece together an adventure through bright, colorful and an inspiring pixel art alongside a gorgeous 8-Bit Synth Soundtrack.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dash &amp; Float mechanics<br></li><li> 8-Bit Inspired Soundtrack<br></li><li> Bright and beautiful pixel art landscape<br></li><li> Challenging hand-crafted levels<br></li><li> Precision Platforming</li></ul><br>Simple mechanics of dashing and floating that use the same stamina bar. Combine the mechanics to complete challenges.<br><br>Artifacts - Collect missing artifacts to unlock portals<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/91671ab1bc68a84ddc4a8b363fa454b6.poster.avif?t=1712980062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/91671ab1bc68a84ddc4a8b363fa454b6.webm?t=1712980062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/91671ab1bc68a84ddc4a8b363fa454b6.mp4?t=1712980062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Portals - unlock portals to continue your quest<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/0b9421cdbda62ece4a60b4cbb6a71d12.poster.avif?t=1712980062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/0b9421cdbda62ece4a60b4cbb6a71d12.webm?t=1712980062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/0b9421cdbda62ece4a60b4cbb6a71d12.mp4?t=1712980062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Dash &amp; Inflate - Manage your stamina as you use both of these mechanics to navigate between floating islands and hazards<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/784993095e9ec87e798747beb92051be.poster.avif?t=1712980062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/784993095e9ec87e798747beb92051be.webm?t=1712980062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/784993095e9ec87e798747beb92051be.mp4?t=1712980062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/c7254316c3ce62ac431d9e18cbef3ea5.poster.avif?t=1712980062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/c7254316c3ce62ac431d9e18cbef3ea5.webm?t=1712980062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1860200/extras/c7254316c3ce62ac431d9e18cbef3ea5.mp4?t=1712980062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
